1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,989
Keep it going.

2
00:00:00,989 --> 00:00:05,078
Inwards, inwards, outwards, inwards, inwards, inwards.

3
00:00:05,078 --> 00:00:10,416
The cambium makes far more xylem than phloem, often several times more.

4
00:00:10,416 --> 00:00:13,463
That is why a tree trunk is almost all wood.

